# IMAP

# See
#  - `/etc/dovecot/conf.d/20-imap.conf`
#  - <https://doc.dovecot.org/settings/core/>

# See also
#  - `./services.conf`


# Only send the name (Dovecot).
#  - In Dovecot 2.4 `imap_id_send` is a String List; its default is
#    `name=%{dovecot:name}`, i.e. it already sends only the name ("Dovecot").
#    The old `name *` value is no longer valid syntax, so we rely on the
#    default.
#imap_id_send = name=%{dovecot:name}
